      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她无法如此宣言。\n神鹰就这样悬空在志气与现实之间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee385e8317aa5f26d75b2049ca483aef7e76a80f243bb0ec7b10d7f7b4617876",
