      "uid": "zhcn:e1b548f3109236996524359f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再这样继续硬撑实在是行不通。\n既然如此，或许在那之前\n先停顿一步会比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d974cf7753627b927228e215d4b3a3e40d75c2099eda3748ede1e171f93ed55",
