      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“每日王冠”……？\n我记得是在秋季GⅠ之前的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "20249e879845b5df184af423b7405693c4a5afd5651a00e7331e2e71d34b1ee4",
