      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本杯”就不用说了，\n要从那里挺进三冠路线的“菊花赏”\n或“英里冠军赛”也没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "468f82a43dc1ac67923e6c6241161ddfeac26bf21232020fb9c8e3ffb9ed062f",
