      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "差点被脱下的面具……原本看起来很清晰的\n世界最强之路，第一次出现了动摇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5c0e3f1251745beeb2b02666842c433df2b0e00ebcf7a7c1ba5512ff8af5454",
